{ "Before Super Resolution", "Sebelum Super Resolution" },
{ "Before the RX 6000 network runs, the runtime compiles every one of its pipelines\nonce, apart from the game. One of them failed, so NR stays off rather than crash.\nThe verdict is kept for this driver (dlssnr-amd\\rdna2-check.txt); a new driver is\nchecked again. mochizuki_nr.log has the details.", "Sebelum jaringan RX 6000 berjalan, runtime meng-compile semua pipeline-nya\nsatu kali, terpisah dari game. Salah satunya gagal, jadi NR tetap mati daripada crash.\nHasilnya disimpan untuk driver ini (dlssnr-amd\\rdna2-check.txt); driver baru\ndiperiksa lagi. Detailnya ada di mochizuki_nr.log." },
{ "Before the RX 7000 network runs, the runtime checks how the driver lays out the GPU's\nmatrices and compiles every one of its pipelines once, apart from the game. One of\nthose failed, so NR stays off rather than draw a wrong picture or crash. The verdict\nis kept for this driver (dlssnr-amd\\rdna3-check.txt); a new driver is checked again.\nmochizuki_nr.log has the details.", "Sebelum jaringan RX 7000 berjalan, runtime memeriksa cara driver menata matriks\nGPU dan meng-compile semua pipeline-nya satu kali, terpisah dari game. Salah satu\ndari itu gagal, jadi NR tetap mati daripada menggambar hasil yang salah atau crash.\nHasilnya disimpan untuk driver ini (dlssnr-amd\\rdna3-check.txt); driver baru\ndiperiksa lagi. Detailnya ada di mochizuki_nr.log." },
{ "Before the upscaler", "Sebelum upscaler" },
{ "Best when can be used, some games are not compatible (e.g. Cyberpunk)\nand will fallback to Aggressive", "Terbaik kalau bisa dipakai, sebagian game tidak kompatibel (mis. Cyberpunk)\ndan akan fallback ke Agresif" },
