{ "Black lift", "Black lift" },
{ "Black lift: the runtime's own lift of the darkest tones on the curve above, 0 by\ndefault (none).\n\nExposure: the brightness the network sees the frame at. Game uses the exposure\nthe game hands the upscaler, when it does; Auto is the runtime's own estimate,\nwhich puts the frame's mean at the middle of the curve.\n\nBoth are danielblnc's own controls and restart the model's history when\nchanged. Needs the danielblnc runtime 0.4.0 or later.", "Black lift: pengangkatan tone tergelap oleh runtime sendiri pada kurva di atas,\n0 secara default (tidak ada).\n\nExposure: kecerahan frame seperti yang dilihat jaringan. Game memakai exposure\nyang dikirim game ke upscaler, kalau ada; Auto adalah perkiraan runtime sendiri,\nyang menaruh rata-rata frame di tengah kurva.\n\nKeduanya kontrol milik danielblnc dan me-restart riwayat model saat\ndiubah. Butuh runtime danielblnc 0.4.0 atau lebih baru." },
{ "Blends only the model's change toward the previous frame. The game's own picture reaches\nthe upscaler as it arrived, so its detail stays.", "Hanya mem-blend perubahan dari model ke arah frame sebelumnya. Gambar asli game sampai\nke upscaler apa adanya, jadi detailnya tetap." },
{ "Block rarely used resources from using as HUDless \nto prevent flickers and other issues\n\nHUDfix enable/disable will reset the block list!", "Blokir resource yang jarang dipakai agar tidak dijadikan HUDless \nuntuk mencegah flicker dan masalah lain\n\nMengaktifkan/menonaktifkan HUDfix akan mereset daftar blokir!" },
