{ "How far CC_SILVER_AARDWOLD_OPTIMIZED goes; every level stays close to CC_SILVER_AARDWOLD's\npicture. Quality: no int4 layers. Balanced: int4 on some encoder, attention and feed-forward\nlayers. Performance: also fixed attention on the first full-resolution layers. Ultra\nPerformance (default, the fastest): also more int4 layers. A change rebuilds the network.", "Seberapa jauh CC_SILVER_AARDWOLD_OPTIMIZED melangkah; tiap level tetap dekat dengan gambar\nCC_SILVER_AARDWOLD. Quality: tanpa layer int4. Balanced: int4 di sebagian layer encoder, attention,\ndan feed-forward. Performance: ditambah fixed attention di layer resolusi penuh pertama. Ultra\nPerformance (default, tercepat): ditambah lebih banyak layer int4. Perubahan membangun ulang jaringan." },
{ "How far each a-trous pass returns a downward-biased estimate\ninstead of the bilateral mean, which bounds the floor below the\nraw colour rather than letting it drift above it. Off by default:\nthe crossing it removes measures about 0.1% of a typical frame,\nwith spikes in views where detail boost lifts the floor.\nFloor Detail Boost is the knob that fixes a soft floor.", "Seberapa jauh tiap pass a-trous mengembalikan estimasi yang bias ke bawah,\nbukan rata-rata bilateral, sehingga floor terbatas di bawah\nwarna mentah dan tidak bergeser ke atasnya. Mati secara default:\ncrossing yang dihilangkannya terukur sekitar 0.1%, pada frame biasa,\ndengan lonjakan di view tempat detail boost mengangkat floor.\nFloor Detail Boost adalah knob yang memperbaiki floor yang lembek." },
{ "How far the frame moves toward the model's picture.\n\nThe model's answer is not added to the frame -- it is a complete picture of its\nown, rescaled so its luminance sits where the original says it should. This\nblends between the two, so both ends are real pictures and everything between\nthem is one too.\n\n0 gives back exactly what the upscaler produced. 1 is the model's picture.\n\nAbove 1 carries on past it in the same direction, which is not something the\nmodel asked for -- use it to see what it is doing, then come back down. This\nis the control to push if you want more effect: Intensity belongs to the model\nand it decides what to do with it.", "Seberapa jauh frame bergerak ke arah gambar model.\n\nJawaban model tidak ditambahkan ke frame -- ia gambar utuh tersendiri,\ndiskalakan ulang supaya luminance-nya berada di tempat yang ditentukan aslinya.\nIni mem-blend di antara keduanya, jadi kedua ujungnya gambar nyata dan semua\nyang di antaranya juga.\n\n0 mengembalikan persis hasil upscaler. 1 adalah gambar model.\n\nDi atas 1 terus melaju melewatinya ke arah yang sama, dan itu bukan sesuatu yang\ndiminta model -- pakai untuk melihat apa yang dilakukannya, lalu turunkan lagi. Ini\nkontrol yang dinaikkan kalau kamu mau efek lebih: Intensitas itu milik model,\ndan model yang memutuskan mau diapakan." },
{ "How far the handover moves from the floor toward the detail filter.\n0.0: the floor's 5x5 full median and a-trous result. Isotropic, so it\nerases strokes thinner than about 3 pixels - this is what removes panel\ntext and blends the original colours.\n1.0: entirely the filter selected below.", "Seberapa jauh handover bergerak dari floor ke arah filter detail.\n0.0: hasil full median 5x5 dan a-trous milik floor. Isotropik, jadi\nmenghapus guratan yang lebih tipis dari sekitar 3 piksel - inilah yang\nmenghilangkan teks panel dan mem-blend warna aslinya.\n1.0: sepenuhnya filter yang dipilih di bawah." },
{ "How long to spin if FPTHybridSpin is true. Measured in timer resolution units.\nNot recommended to go below 2. Will result in frequent overshoots", "Berapa lama spin kalau FPTHybridSpin true. Diukur dalam satuan resolusi timer.\nTidak disarankan di bawah 2. Akan sering overshoot" },
{ "How many frames may be running denoise at once, 2-5. A frame that gets\na buffer waits for its own denoise; one that finds all buffers busy is\nrecorded with NO denoise at all - faster, with possible quality loss.\n\n3 (default): on Onimusha no difference from 2 was detected. In one Where\nWinds Meet A/B session, the skip counter rose by about 1200-1440 per\ntwo-slot segment and stayed flat with 3; that log window does not yield\na skip percentage.\n\n2: in that Where Winds Meet session, display latency was 47.6-47.9 ms\nversus 62.9-63.2 ms with 3, but many frames skipped denoise.\n\n4-5: measured in a separate sweep and no faster than 3 in that scene. A\nscene that actually requires a fourth or fifth slot has not been tested.\n\nEach buffer is one FP16 target at the RENDER size (the DLSS input): about\n29 MB when a 4K output renders at 1440p, 66 MB only at a native 4K render.\nOnly the selected number is allocated. No restart needed.\n\nThe ini also accepts 1 (the old single-slot path); this menu does not.", "Berapa frame yang boleh menjalankan denoise sekaligus, 2-5. Frame yang dapat\nbuffer menunggu denoise-nya sendiri; yang mendapati semua buffer sibuk\ndirekam TANPA denoise sama sekali - lebih cepat, dengan kemungkinan kualitas turun.\n\n3 (default): di Onimusha tidak terdeteksi beda dari 2. Di satu sesi A/B Where\nWinds Meet, skip counter naik sekitar 1200-1440 per\nsegmen dua slot dan tetap datar dengan 3; jendela log itu tidak menghasilkan\npersentase skip.\n\n2: di sesi Where Winds Meet itu, latensi display 47.6-47.9 ms\nberbanding 62.9-63.2 ms dengan 3, tapi banyak frame melewatkan denoise.\n\n4-5: diukur di sweep terpisah dan tidak lebih cepat dari 3 di scene itu. Scene\nyang benar-benar butuh slot keempat atau kelima belum diuji.\n\nTiap buffer adalah satu target FP16 seukuran RENDER (input DLSS): sekitar\n29 MB saat output 4K di-render di 1440p, 66 MB hanya pada render 4K native.\nHanya jumlah yang dipilih yang dialokasikan. Tidak perlu restart.\n\nFile .ini juga menerima 1 (jalur satu slot yang lama); menu ini tidak." },
{ "How many times the model runs over the frame, each pass shown the last one's\nanswer.\n\nThe most expensive control here. Cost is exactly linear: five passes is\nfive model runs, and the model is nearly all of what this pass costs.\n\nWhat it buys that nothing else can is the model re-deciding where detail\ngoes, what hue it is, and how saturated. Detail strength amplifies the map\nthe first pass drew; it cannot redraw it.\n\nWhat it does not buy is raw magnitude. Detail strength and Intensity are\nfree and do that. Try both, and raise Model resolution, before this.\n\nPast 3, raise the ratio guard under Colour with it. The passes compound\nthe luminance ratio and the guard clamps it, so beyond its limit the extra\nruns are paid for and thrown away.\n\nEach pass is its own model, with its own memory, built on a frame of its\nown -- so raising this takes a couple of seconds to arrive, and VRAM grows\nwith it.\n\nNo effect on native Vulkan, or with the proxy path switched on.", "Berapa kali model dijalankan pada frame, tiap pass diperlihatkan jawaban\npass sebelumnya.\n\nKontrol paling mahal di sini. Biayanya persis linear: lima pass berarti\nlima kali model jalan, dan model adalah hampir seluruh biaya pass ini.\n\nYang didapat dan tak bisa diberikan kontrol lain: model memutuskan ulang ke mana\ndetail pergi, apa hue-nya, dan seberapa jenuh. Kekuatan detail memperkuat peta\nyang digambar pass pertama; tidak bisa menggambarnya ulang.\n\nYang tidak didapat adalah besaran mentah. Kekuatan detail dan Intensitas itu\ngratis dan melakukan hal itu. Coba keduanya, dan naikkan Resolusi model, sebelum ini.\n\nDi atas 3, naikkan juga Pengaman highlight di bagian Warna. Pass-pass ini\nmelipatgandakan rasio luminance dan pengaman meng-clamp-nya, jadi di luar batasnya\npass tambahan tetap dibayar lalu dibuang.\n\nTiap pass adalah model tersendiri, dengan memori sendiri, dibangun pada frame\ntersendiri -- jadi menaikkan ini butuh beberapa detik untuk muncul, dan VRAM ikut\nnaik.\n\nTidak berpengaruh di Vulkan native, atau saat jalur proxy dinyalakan." },
{ "How much of NR's change reaches the people in the mask: 1 the pass they keep, 0 the game's own\npicture there. Before the stabilizer and RenoDX's composition, which still act on the result.", "Seberapa banyak perubahan NR yang sampai ke orang di dalam mask: 1 pass yang mereka pertahankan, 0 gambar\nasli game di sana. Sebelum stabilizer dan komposisi RenoDX, yang tetap bekerja pada hasilnya." },
{ "How much of it lands", "Seberapa banyak yang sampai" },
{ "How much of the frame each half shows.\n\nA half is half as wide as the frame and just as tall, so the frame\ncannot fill it and keep its shape.\n\nAt 1 the whole frame is there at its right proportions, with bars above\nand below. At 2 the half is filled and the sides are cropped away\ninstead. Anything between trades one for the other.", "Seberapa banyak bagian frame yang ditampilkan tiap separuh.\n\nSatu separuh lebarnya setengah frame dan tingginya sama, jadi frame\ntidak bisa memenuhinya sambil mempertahankan bentuknya.\n\nDi 1 seluruh frame tampil dengan proporsi yang benar, dengan bar di atas\ndan bawah. Di 2 separuh itu terisi penuh dan sisi-sisinya yang terpotong.\nDi antaranya, yang satu ditukar dengan yang lain." },
{ "How much of the model's colour change reaches the frame. Above 1 it is\nexaggerated, up to twice its size at 2.", "Seberapa banyak perubahan warna dari model yang sampai ke frame. Di atas 1\ndilebih-lebihkan, sampai dua kali lipat di 2." },
{ "How much of the model's detail reaches the frame. Above 1 it is\nexaggerated, up to twice its size at 2.", "Seberapa banyak detail dari model yang sampai ke frame. Di atas 1\ndilebih-lebihkan, sampai dua kali lipat di 2." },
{ "How much of the network's result reaches the frame. 100% is the\nruntime's own default; 0% leaves the frame as the game drew it while\nthe network still runs. Above 100% the effect is pushed further.\n\nWith RenoDX composition on, this is the composition's intensity: above\n100% only the brightness change grows, inside the highlight guard, and\nchanging it keeps the model's history. Off, it sets the runtime's own\nstrength and every change restarts the model's history.\n\nNeeds the danielblnc runtime 0.3.1 or later without the composition.", "Seberapa banyak hasil jaringan yang sampai ke frame. 100% berarti\ndefault runtime sendiri; 0% membiarkan frame seperti yang digambar game\nsementara jaringan tetap berjalan. Di atas 100%, efeknya didorong lebih jauh.\n\nDengan komposisi RenoDX menyala, ini intensitas komposisi: di atas\n100%, hanya perubahan kecerahan yang bertambah, di dalam pengaman highlight,\ndan mengubahnya tidak menghapus riwayat model. Kalau mati, ini mengatur\nkekuatan runtime sendiri dan setiap perubahan me-restart riwayat model.\n\nButuh runtime danielblnc 0.3.1 atau lebih baru tanpa komposisi." },
{ "How much of the previous frame's result the network's last block blends into this\none. Lower follows changes faster and steadies less. Even at 0 the network still\nreads the history; turn Temporal history off to drop it.", "Seberapa banyak hasil frame sebelumnya yang di-blend blok terakhir jaringan ke frame\nini. Lebih rendah mengikuti perubahan lebih cepat dan kurang menstabilkan. Bahkan di 0\njaringan tetap membaca riwayat; matikan Riwayat temporal untuk membuangnya." },
{ "How the game's depth buffer is interpreted.\nAuto trusts a depth-stencil resource over the title's declaration,\nthen the DLSS.Use.HW.Depth declaration, then the resource flags,\nand finally assumes Hardware. The log reports which rule fired.\n\nA title that supplies hardware depth without declaring it makes RR\nsee a scene about one unit deep: the linear-depth debug view goes\nblack and disocclusion stops working. Set Hardware if you see that.\nApplied immediately; changing it resets temporal history.", "Cara depth buffer game ditafsirkan.\nAuto lebih memercayai resource depth-stencil daripada deklarasi game,\nlalu deklarasi DLSS.Use.HW.Depth, lalu flag resource,\ndan terakhir menganggap Hardware. Log melaporkan aturan mana yang terpakai.\n\nGame yang memberi hardware depth tanpa mendeklarasikannya membuat RR\nmelihat scene sedalam kira-kira satu unit: tampilan debug linear-depth jadi\nhitam dan disocclusion berhenti bekerja. Pilih Hardware kalau melihat itu.\nLangsung diterapkan; mengubahnya mereset riwayat temporal." },
{ "How the model's work is brought back up when it ran below the frame's size.\n\nClassic composes the model's small picture directly against the full-size\nframe. Those two disagree by the shrink's blur as well as by the model's edit,\nand the composition cannot tell them apart -- it reads the blur as brightness\nthe frame has and the model never saw. The lower the model resolution the\nlarger that error, and it is the colour shift that shows up at 50%.\n\nMatched residual carries up only the model's difference and lays it on the\nframe's own proxy, so both pictures being compared are full size and the only\nthing that came from the small raster is the edit itself.\n\nNo effect at 100% or above: there is no residual to carry and the two are\nidentical (supersampling brings its answer down to frame size before this).\n\nFrom hhkbble's multi-pass work on this fork.", "Cara hasil kerja model dinaikkan lagi saat ia berjalan di bawah ukuran frame.\n\nKlasik mengomposisikan gambar kecil model langsung terhadap frame ukuran\npenuh. Keduanya berbeda karena blur akibat pengecilan sekaligus karena editan model,\ndan komposisi tidak bisa membedakannya -- blur itu dibaca sebagai kecerahan\nyang dimiliki frame dan tak pernah dilihat model. Makin rendah resolusi model, makin\nbesar error itu, dan itulah pergeseran warna yang muncul di 50%.\n\nResidual selaras hanya menaikkan selisih dari model dan menaruhnya di atas\nproxy milik frame sendiri, jadi kedua gambar yang dibandingkan berukuran penuh dan\nsatu-satunya yang berasal dari raster kecil adalah editan itu sendiri.\n\nTidak berpengaruh di 100% ke atas: tidak ada residual untuk dibawa dan keduanya\nidentik (supersampling menurunkan jawabannya ke ukuran frame sebelum ini).\n\nDari kerja multi-pass hhkbble di fork ini." },
